<title>JAMAICA: CRICKET-WESTINDIES V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WESTINDIES V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the fourth day of</p>
<p>the first test between West Indies and India at Sabina Park on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>West India first innings 427 (C.Hooper 129, B.Lara 83)</p>
<p>India first innings (overnight 308-7)</p>
