<p> A.Kumble b Bishop		     7</p>
<p> S.Joshi b Bishop		     43</p>
<p> A.Kuruvilla b Rose		    0</p>
<p> V.Prasad not out		     10</p>
<p> Extras (b-5 lb-9 nb-23)	    37</p>
<p> Total				   346</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-32 2-127 3-140 4-145 5-153 6-234 7- 248</p>
